<title>THAILAND: Hipro debuts on Thai bourse at 28 baht.</title>
<headline>Hipro debuts on Thai bourse at 28 baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Power component manufacturing firm Hipro Electronics Plc debuted on the Thai stock exchange on Friday at 28 baht against its initial public offer of 32 baht.</p>
<p>At 0304 GMT, Hipro eased further to 27.50 baht.</p>
<p>Hipro recently floated 5.4 million of its 27 million shares before its listing.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are expected to sell the stock because the overall market is bearish,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
